#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:2
#: ff16db9289de417db68fd80da3634d48
msgid "Rayleigh-Bénard Convection"
msgstr "瑞利-贝纳德对流"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:4
#: 54d6e89b82c54ab28550508156572a0e
msgid ""
"The Rayleigh-Bénard problem couples incompressible fluid flow with heat "
"transport: a horizontal cavity heated from below, cooled from above, "
"develops convective rolls once the buoyancy force exceeds the dissipative "
"effects of viscosity and thermal diffusion. The script "
"``examples/fluid/rayleigh_benard/rayleigh_benard.py`` solves the Boussinesq "
"approximation in a 2:1 aspect-ratio rectangular cavity at a configurable "
"Rayleigh number."
msgstr ""
"瑞利-贝纳德问题将不可压缩流体流动与热输运耦合：一个水平空腔从底部加热、顶部冷却，当浮力超过粘性和热扩散的耗散效应时，会形成对流卷。脚本 "
"``examples/fluid/rayleigh_benard/rayleigh_benard.py`` 在宽高比为 2:1 "
"的矩形空腔中求解布辛涅斯克近似，瑞利数可配置。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:12
#: 1d7eef43a7264ccb80211e01b5777ed8
msgid ""
"This is the gallery's **three-field mixed** example: Taylor-Hood P2-P1 "
"velocity/pressure *plus* a P2 temperature, all declared on one "
":class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler`. The buoyancy coupling and the "
"energy equation are just more terms of the same scalar integrand — no per-"
"node block stamping, no stabilization."
msgstr ""
"这是图库中的 **三场混合** 示例：泰勒-胡德 P2-P1 速度/压力 *外加* P2 温度，全部声明在一个 "
":class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler` "
"上。浮力耦合和能量方程只是同一标量被积函数的更多项——无需逐节点块填充，无需稳定化。"

