#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:52
#: c303ed9516074a36bb107766ae8649c3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"controls the regime: below :math:`\\mathrm{Ra}_c \\approx 1708` heat "
"transfer is purely conductive; above it convective rolls appear. The script "
"defaults to :math:`\\mathrm{Ra} = 2 \\times 10^4` (:math:`\\mathrm{Pr} = "
"1`), comfortably in the steady-convective regime."
msgstr ""
"控制流动状态：当瑞利数低于 :math:`\\mathrm{Ra}_c \\approx 1708` "
"时，传热为纯导热；超过该值则出现对流卷。脚本默认使用 :math:`\\mathrm{Ra} = 2 \\times 10^4`\\ （\\ "
":math:`\\mathrm{Pr} = 1`\\ ），处于稳定的对流状态。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:58
#: f53f99d34c954d0ab6c017f574dfd4aa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Why march in time?** The conductive state (linear temperature, zero "
"velocity) is a steady solution at *every* Rayleigh number — a steady solver "
"started from rest simply converges to it. Above :math:`\\mathrm{Ra}_c` that "
"state is unstable, so the script perturbs the conductive profile slightly "
"and integrates backward Euler in time: the instability grows physically into"
" convection rolls, and the run stops when the solution stops changing."
msgstr ""
"**为何进行时间推进？** 导热状态（线性温度分布、零速度）在 *任意* 瑞利数下都是稳态解——从静止开始的稳态求解器会直接收敛到该解。当瑞利数超过 "
":math:`\\mathrm{Ra}_c` "
"时，该状态不稳定，因此脚本对导热温度分布施加微小扰动，并采用向后欧拉法进行时间积分：不稳定性会物理地增长为对流卷，当解不再变化时运行停止。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:68
#: 634bf77e3c0341cdac74499a1e59dbd9
msgid "Three fields, one integrand"
msgstr "三场，一个被积函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:70
#: 8eee91180cb447dcbb40c1777ece5c26
msgid ""
"The unknowns are declared as three fields — trial names ``(u, p, T)``, test "
"names ``(v, q, s)``. Every term of the coupled weak form pairs one trial "
"factor with one test factor, so the whole system is one bilinear integrand:"
msgstr ""
"未知量声明为三个场——试函数名 ``(u, p, T)``\\ ，测试函数名 ``(v, q, s)``\\ "
"。耦合弱形式的每一项将一个试函数因子与一个测试函数因子配对，因此整个系统是一个双线性被积函数："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:75
#: efa4ec10a08648529d66681c80f8d166
msgid "examples/fluid/rayleigh_benard/rayleigh_benard.py (essence)"
msgstr "examples/fluid/rayleigh_benard/rayleigh_benard.py（核心部分）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:105
#: 392fefe55c0246cc8a12930ea87e1922
msgid "Two couplings deserve a closer look:"
msgstr "两种耦合值得仔细分析："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:107
#: b8796b647ef54030bb0d6a8a97c97154
msgid ""
"**Buoyancy** ``- rho g beta T v[1]`` pairs the *trial temperature* with the "
"*vertical velocity test function* — an off-diagonal :math:`(v, T)` block "
"that the mixed assembler extracts automatically. Temperature therefore feeds"
" back into momentum **fully implicitly**; only the advecting velocity ``w`` "
"is lagged (Picard)."
msgstr ""
"**浮力项** ``- rho g beta T v[1]`` 将 *试函数温度* 与 *垂直速度测试函数* 配对——一个非对角 :math:`(v, "
"T)` 块，由混合装配器自动提取。因此温度以 **全隐式** 方式反馈到动量方程中；只有对流速度 ``w`` 采用滞后处理（皮卡迭代）。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:113
#: 7f07f8e25c3a4cea858b85e240bd7686
msgid ""
"**Energy transport** ``w.dot(gradT) * s + kappa * gradT.dot(grads)`` is a "
"scalar advection-diffusion equation riding in the same matrix, with the same"
" lagged ``w``."
msgstr ""
"**能量输运** ``w.dot(gradT) * s + kappa * gradT.dot(grads)`` 是嵌在同一矩阵中的标量对流-"
"扩散方程，采用相同的滞后速度 ``w``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:119
#: 49b4e9afabdb45d7910a04f117188a25
msgid "Time marching to the attractor"
msgstr "时间推进至吸引子"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:121
#: 8447ef4dcd5741448643709bbd44359c
msgid ""
"Each backward-Euler step assembles the matrix with the current velocity and "
"the load vector with the previous fields, both through the same assembler:"
msgstr "每个向后欧拉步通过同一装配器，用当前速度装配矩阵，用上一时刻的场装配载荷向量："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:139
#: c6dd0229cf504627b2b4fbcd8db199cf
msgid ""
"On the order-2 mesh both P2 fields (velocity and temperature) live on the "
"mesh points, so the lagged data goes through plain ``point_data`` and the "
"final fields plot directly."
msgstr "在二阶网格上，两个 P2 场（速度和温度）均定义在网格节点上，因此滞后数据通过普通 ``point_data`` 传递，最终场可直接绘图。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:143
#: 560d57701d0f4e1db9c6288206cd6b0c
msgid "Rayleigh-Bénard temperature and velocity magnitude"
msgstr "瑞利-贝纳德对流的温度与速度大小"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/rayleigh_benard.rst:147
#: 4f9f9f3b6ade4c39aa04981ec6374770
msgid ""
"Output of ``rayleigh_benard.py``. Left: temperature field — the warm bottom "
"wall sends rising plumes that split at the cold top into cool downward "
"plumes. Right: velocity magnitude — counter-rotating convection rolls, with "
"peak speeds along the rising / sinking columns and stagnation at the roll "
"centers."
msgstr ""
"``rayleigh_benard.py`` "
"的输出。左：温度场——温暖的底部壁面产生上升羽流，在冷顶部分裂为向下流动的冷羽流。右：速度大小——反向旋转的对流卷，上升/下沉柱处速度最大，卷心处为滞止点。"

